      "instance_name": "animal_intelligence_research",
      "label": "Animal Intelligence Research",
      "description": "Animal intelligence research is a legitimate scientific field that studies the cognitive abilities of non-human animals. The meme references this field in a sarcastic way, implying that Michelle Obama is fundraising for research into animal intelligence, which is a ridiculous and demeaning suggestion. This real-world concept is necessary to understand the absurdity and mockery in the meme.",
