      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "Michelle Obama is mapped onto the chimpanzee",
      "description": "The top text 'michele obama' is juxtaposed with the image of a chimpanzee, creating an analogical mapping where Michelle Obama is equated with the chimpanzee. This mapping is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it uses the visual of the chimpanzee to mock Michelle Obama by implying she is 'animal-like' or unintelligent, invoking the anti-Black stereotype of comparing Black people to primates.",
